  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "shannon.cox@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker (NYSE: SYK) announced today a definitive merger agreement to acquire all of the issued and outstanding shares of common stock of K2M Group Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: KTWO). K2M, which was founded in 2004, has emerged as a key player in the roughly $10 billion spinal market.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>See full press release&nbsp;<a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-announces-definitive-agreement-to-acquire-K2M/default.aspx\"><b>here</b></a>:</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 11 2019 18:46:52 GMT+0000",
